### Direct reference app - list SI laboratories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/laboratories
X-Tenant-ID: SI

### Direct reference app - list IF laboratories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/laboratories
X-Tenant-ID: IF

### Create SI reservation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: SI

{
  "laboratoryId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-09-20T01:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-20T03:00:00Z",
  "purpose": "Cloud Computing Practical"
}

### Negative tenant-isolation test: ask SI tenant for an IF laboratory id
# Change the laboratoryId to an ID that belongs to another tenant and verify it is rejected.
